      <activity id="19f0bebe-3d06-5699-9a7d-ddfdc66c56f6" activityNameId="b3922479-b904-5f9d-950e-b1cf2fce6625" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Trimethyl borate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Trimethyl borate, at plant
The process "trimethylborate, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  trimethylborate from boric acid in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation. Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000121-43-7; 
Formula: (CH3O)3B; 
Synonyms: methyl borate, boric acid trimethyl ester, boron methoxide; 
UUID: afe7026a-4272-3e6b-9b1b-fa54d433923f
Production of trimethylborate including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Methylation of boric acid
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_afe7026a-4272-3e6b-9b1b-fa54d433923f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
